fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstinfo.html#gst_log_context_builder_build","fragment":"\n\tgst_log_context_builder_build\n\nBuilds a GstLogContext from the builder configuration.\nThe builder is consumed by this function and should not be used afterward.\nParameters:\na GstLogContextBuilder\na new GstLogContext\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});